  src: '{"name":"hall_bath_door","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Free Wood Door Pack/Prefab/Wood/Door_3/Door_3_White.prefab","x":[8.306,8.366],"z":[10.2321,10.9909],"y0":0.0,"height":2.087,"back":"+x","hides":["Casing"],"collide":false,"open":85,"hinge":"hi","source":"user walk note Oct 18 03:14 (foyer rear, shot 20261018-031353): ''these doors should all be replaced with real doors, the same doors used elsewhere inside'' (overnight 12, not walked). Door_3 White as the other interior doors (linen, girls_a/b, attic, Buzz, parents; the film''s are white six-panel: DEVIATIONS 63h). The pack frame (outer = leaf x 1.124 wide, x 1.027 tall) centred on the opening, 0.5 cm proud of the face, 6 cm deep. Opening z 10.274-10.949 (0.675 m, a 26.5 in leaf: the opening''s measured width kept, not a stock 28) had no leaf. Frame on the hall corridor face (x 8.371), replacing its casing. Hinge ASSUMED at the hi end (z 10.949, nearer the bath''s z 11.43 wall); swings into the bath; open 85 deg AUTHORED."}'
  c0: {x: 8.659782, y: 1.0435, z: -10.6115}
