  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2377527760670665664}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: de2b5d5ea06784d29910927b98e863a1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlacedProp
  spec: store_props
  yaw: 270
  rot0: {x: -0, y: 0.7071068, z: -0, w: -0.7071068}
  src: '{"name":"kitchen_hutch","prefab":"Assets/Models/PolyHaven/vintage_cabinet_01.glb","x":[3.61,4.11],"z":[4.66,6.43],"y0":0.0,"height":2.2,"back":"+x","collide":true,"hides":[],"source":"props lane (props.py add, Oct 19): film 1024 (glazed white hutch behind the breakfast table, white door to its right), production still ''Breakfast Room'' (art/home_alone/references/kitchen/production-breakfast-hutch.jpg), user photo IMG_4305 (film still: white built-in beyond the island, glazed upper doors, open dish shelves, closed lower cabinets), Marina 924 s (best-marina-0924: white built-in on the wall between the dining doorway and the white door, glazed 4-bay upper, open shelf, drawers + doors). It is a BUILT-IN in the film and Marina; placed in the props lane at the user''s request (walk note Oct 19 08:42) as a pack china cabinet fitted to the run between the dining doors (wall z 4.50-6.46 inside the casings; the wider wallpaper strip with the switch on the door-1 side, Marina 924): 1.77 x 0.50 x 2.20 m, Poly Haven vintage_cabinet_01 (CC0, 2.02 x 0.67 x 2.24, fitted x0.88/x0.75/x0.98), painted the film''s white: \"paint\" [0.80,0.79,0.74] = base map dropped, flat lin colour, smoothness 0.45 (applied LIVE by editor eval Oct 19; StoreProps.cs does not read \"paint\" yet, so a build shows the model''s dark wood until it does; a tint can''t whiten it: the map is lin 0.04/0.016/0.008 with 6x grain contrast). Deviation: arched carved crown and dark wood grain under the tint; the film''s is flat-topped painted white. Revisit with a generated built-in (fixture gate).. Model 2.022 x 0.67 x 2.235 m (vintage_cabinet_01), fitted to 1.77 x 0.5 x 2.2.","yaw":270,"paint":[0.8,0.79,0.74]}'
  c0: {x: 3.86, y: -1.926, z: -5.545}
