  src: '{"name":"hall_table_attic","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Classic Wooden Furniture Pack/Prefabs/SIDE_TABLE_01.prefab","x":[7.003,7.303],"z":[12.4,13.3],"y0":0.0,"height":0.762,"back":"+x","source":"Upstairs hall (Oct 16, TRIAL, changes/2026-10-16-upstairs-hall.json; furniture-plan H2): owned SIDE_TABLE_01 as the film''s dark hall table (film 352/410/1276/1333: beside the attic door under the tapestry). Box from spec/dressing/hall.json consoles: top 0.762 (film 10819: on the horizon with the cap rail, camera height 0.759 on the door ruler), 0.90 x 0.30, back 3 cm off the wall (the cap rail is 3 cm proud at the table''s height). The model (0.945 x 0.473 x 0.645) is fitted x0.95 / x0.63 / x1.18: slimmer and taller; its cabriole legs differ from the film''s square tapered legs (DEVIATIONS 63).","yaw":270}'
