  src: '{"name":"parents_armoire","floor":"upper","prefab":"Assets/Classic Wooden Furniture Pack/Prefabs/WARDROBE_01.prefab","x":[7.28,8.43],"z":[3.121,3.711],"y0":0.0,"height":2.05,"hides":["parents_armoire"],"collide":false,"back":"+z","source":"Parents'' bedroom TRIAL 1 (changes/2026-10-18-parents-room.json; tools/house/parents_layout.py): Marina 180/188/184: dark armoire right of the front windows, against the notch wall (z 3.721) in the front corner; the film never shows it clearly (Marina only). WARDROBE_01 fitted to 1.15 x 0.59 x 2.05 (her bonnet top ~2.1), stained dark (tint: the pack''s oak read light beside her dark armoire); yaw 0 pinned (user walk Oct 18: the auto turn''s 180 put the doors to the wall)","tint":[0.36,0.24,0.21],"yaw":0}'
  c0: {x: 7.8550005, y: 1.025, z: -3.416}
